:''Not to be confused with the stage [[Wicked Axe]], its Cat counterpart [[Brainwashed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Axe Cat]] or [[Malevolent Dark Cat]].''
'''Wicked Axe Cat''' (邪悪なバトルネコ ''Jaakuna Batoru Neko'', '''Wicked Battle Cat''') is an [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]]-turned-[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]. It is introduced in the [[Wicked Axe]] event, which is unlocked after clearing [[Demon's Park]]. Although [[Brainwashed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Axe Cat]] is visually an allied counterpart of Wicked Axe Cat, it is not obtained by defeating this enemy, but rather from [[:Category:Seasonal Gacha Events|seasonal]] [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] events. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

