==Enemy==
Wicked Axe Cat is a fast-attacking, mid-ranged powerhouse that basically acts as a nerfed [[Crazed Axe Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Axe Cat]] with the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait and a rather strong [[Shield]] in place of the freeze ability. It also strengthens by 100% when on the last of its three knockbacks.

==Strategy==
The Shield more than doubles Wicked Axe Cat's effective health, so bringing [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]] is recommended to take care of it. Due to the threat posed by this enemy's damage, it is also recommended to use plenty of meatshields and avoid short-ranged attackers, instead relying on cats with over 360 range, like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

